   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EDU.2025.Cambodia.02/ITC: AI for societal Good-</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance research capacity of the Institute of Technology of Cambodia (ITC) and support collaborative research between ITC and DCU in Artificial Intelligence (AI) and environment health. It delivers targeted knowledge transfer, strengthens professional networks between Cambodian and Irish researchers/ healthcare practitioners, and creates substantial opportunities for Cambodian scholars and staff to gain advanced training and experience in Ireland,</narrative>
